{"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","is_bot":false,"login":"konard","name":"Konstantin Diachenko"},"baseRefName":"main","baseRefOid":"19933d4f819031ee32f985a35c62a5f5f660b51a","body":"## Summary\n\n- explicitly dispatch the existing release workflow in a non-publishing `validate-pr` mode for release pull requests created with `GITHUB_TOKEN`\n- wait for that exact validation run to succeed before attempting the ruleset-protected merge, and abort without merging when validation fails\n- preserve least privilege with job-scoped `actions: write`, keep validation preflight in report mode, and cover both automatic and instant release paths through the shared landing helper\n- add a failing-first regression, update all four CI/CD best-practice translations, and include the required patch changeset\n\n## Root cause and reproduction\n\nAt 2026-09-20 04:28:10 UTC, the main ruleset began strictly requiring `Pipeline Status`. The existing fallback opened its release PR with `GITHUB_TOKEN`; GitHub left the ordinary `pull_request` workflows in `action_required`, so no `Pipeline Status` check was ever created. Ten merge retries could only repeat the invariant policy failure.\n\nThis reproduced in four consecutive main runs, creating release PRs #2268, #2272, #2273, and #2276. All twelve workflows attached to those PRs are `action_required`.\n\nBefore this change:\n\n1. direct version push is rejected by the ruleset\n2. fallback release PR is created\n3. required check never starts\n4. all merge attempts fail with `Required status check \"Pipeline Status\" is expected`\n\nAfter this change, the fallback dispatches `release.yml` on the generated head with `release_mode=validate-pr`, watches the returned run with `--exit-status`, and reaches merge only after successful validation. Publication jobs remain restricted to a push on `main` or explicit `instant` mode.\n\n## Verification\n\n- final evidence head `63f2f24f` — [Checks and release](https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/actions/runs/35529722059), [Security](https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/actions/runs/35529721830), [Workflows](https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/actions/runs/35529721877), and [Broken Link Checker](https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/actions/runs/35529721810) all passed\n- implementation candidate `1e1de488` — all four workflows passed, including full Docker/container validation; its complete logs are archived in the evidence bundle\n- `npm test` — all 495 selected test files passed\n- `node scripts/run-tests.mjs --suite github-integration` — selected integration file passed, 4/4 assertions\n- `npm run lint`\n- `npm run format:check`\n- `npm run check:duplication`\n- `npm run check:secrets`\n- `node tests/extracted-modules-2198.test.mjs`\n- `bash scripts/check-file-line-limits.sh` — `release.yml` is 1,348 lines\n- issue #2274 regression verifies validation-before-merge and proves failed validation never calls merge\n\n## Evidence and related project\n\nThe complete investigation is archived in [`dev/log/issues/2274/pulls/2275`](https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/tree/issue-2274-beb53fa7caf4/dev/log/issues/2274/pulls/2275), including the timeline, every requirement, root-cause/solution matrix, eight full CI logs, ruleset version history, annotation audit, template file/checksum comparison, local test logs, and primary-source research.\n\nThe same defect exists in the upstream JavaScript CI/CD template and is reported with reproductions, workarounds, and a code-level fix plan in link-foundation/js-ai-driven-development-pipeline-template#192.\n\nFixes #2274\n","closedAt":"2026-09-20T18:53:15Z","commits":[{"authoredDate":"2026-09-20T17:39:02Z","authors":[{"email":"drakonard@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","login":"konard","name":"konard"}],"committedDate":"2026-09-20T17:39:02Z","messageBody":"Adding .gitkeep for PR creation (default mode).\nThis file will be removed when the task is complete.\n\nIssue: https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/2274","messageHeadline":"Initial commit with task details","oid":"02146eec377c320d468d697dc32e7e77aa959da6"},{"authoredDate":"2026-09-20T17:44:17Z","authors":[{"email":"drakonard@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","login":"konard","name":"konard"}],"committedDate":"2026-09-20T17:44:17Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/main' into issue-2274-beb53fa7caf4","oid":"8c4e0614d73706db1eb8eb53940925c798903c0f"},{"authoredDate":"2026-09-20T17:45:51Z","authors":[{"email":"drakonard@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","login":"konard","name":"konard"}],"committedDate":"2026-09-20T17:45:51Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"test(release): reproduce required-check deadlock","oid":"dcf215b1814c49dd8e4a56e7a6f27c52c2eda4b9"},{"authoredDate":"2026-09-20T17:58:03Z","authors":[{"email":"drakonard@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","login":"konard","name":"konard"}],"committedDate":"2026-09-20T18:13:11Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"fix(release): validate ruleset fallback PRs","oid":"ba12d5a329439d07c58d27ec978823a801f48282"},{"authoredDate":"2026-09-20T18:13:42Z","authors":[{"email":"drakonard@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","login":"konard","name":"konard"}],"committedDate":"2026-09-20T18:13:42Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"chore: remove pull request placeholder","oid":"3888b16d2e940bac3aac85e461ebff29f6e8eb1d"},{"authoredDate":"2026-09-20T18:14:23Z","authors":[{"email":"drakonard@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","login":"konard","name":"konard"}],"committedDate":"2026-09-20T18:15:36Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"docs(ci): archive issue 2274 investigation","oid":"1e1de488356dd076a4a62132b78336d1cef00c80"},{"authoredDate":"2026-09-20T18:38:27Z","authors":[{"email":"drakonard@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","login":"konard","name":"konard"}],"committedDate":"2026-09-20T18:38:27Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"docs(ci): record passing PR verification","oid